{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">歐洲央行維持利率不變，符合市場預期。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">基準存款利率保持於2.25厘，主要再融資利率和邊際貸款利率，分別為2.4厘和2.65厘。歐洲央行六月曾經加息0.25厘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T14:39:14.227693+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}